# Line-ending policy.
# The tree is normalized to LF in the index so Windows and Linux checkouts
# produce the same diffs (the 42k-line phantom diff after a Windows session
# was pure CRLF noise). Windows-only scripts keep CRLF so cmd.exe keeps
# working; captured serial logs are byte-exact and must never be converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# The serial capture must keep its exact bytes (CRLF, ANSI escapes).
assets/*.ansi -text
